4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive in the club on all sorts of inflatable physics floats.\u00a0Move fast, but remember to drive safely... Jump if you see something in front of you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play some Beach Ball game with your friend?!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/21b5d65af28e839eaa3bf96edd15e7fc.poster.avif?t=1750461409\" width=614 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/21b5d65af28e839eaa3bf96edd15e7fc.webm?t=1750461409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/21b5d65af28e839eaa3bf96edd15e7fc.mp4?t=1750461409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it bounce? Yes! Play with a Beach Ball with some funny physics, defend and score goals with your buddies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the DJ, dance and more!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/3dd86dbf0507516a117e523d07699e1e.poster.avif?t=1750461409\" width=614 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/3dd86dbf0507516a117e523d07699e1e.webm?t=1750461409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540360/extras/3dd86dbf0507516a117e523d07699e1e.mp4?t=1750461409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the mood and choose the music for you and your friends. Dance everywhere, on the floor, on the pole!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Renders! All animations are played in Real-Time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy